[TITLE]
Land use coverages above 100 percent (issue #124): S1 takes two land uses at
100 percent each, S3 60 + 50 percent across two lines; S2 adds to 100 with
rounding (33.33 / 33.33 / 33.34) and must stay quiet.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
LINK_OFFSETS         DEPTH
MIN_SLOPE            0
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             01:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             01:00:00
ROUTING_STEP         5

[RAINGAGES]
;;Name  Format     Interval  SCF  Source
G1      INTENSITY  0:05      1.0  TIMESERIES  R1

[SUBCATCHMENTS]
;;Name  Gage  Outlet  Area  %Imperv  Width  %Slope  CurbLen
S1      G1    J1      5     50       500    1       0
S2      G1    J1      5     50       500    1       0
S3      G1    J1      5     50       500    1       0

[SUBAREAS]
;;Subcat  N-Imperv  N-Perv  S-Imperv  S-Perv  PctZero  RouteTo
S1        0.01      0.1     0.05      0.05    25       OUTLET
S2        0.01      0.1     0.05      0.05    25       OUTLET
S3        0.01      0.1     0.05      0.05    25       OUTLET

[INFILTRATION]
;;Subcat  MaxRate  MinRate  Decay  DryTime  MaxInfil
S1        3.0      0.5      4      7        0
S2        3.0      0.5      4      7        0
S3        3.0      0.5      4      7        0

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J1       10    5         0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev  Type  Stage  Gated
O1       0     FREE         NO

[CONDUITS]
;;Name  From  To   Length  Rough   In  Out  Init  Max
C1       J1    O1   400     0.01    0   0    0     0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link  Shape     Geom1  Geom2  Geom3  Geom4  Barrels
C1       CIRCULAR  1.0    0      0      0      1

[POLLUTANTS]
;;Name  Units  Crain  Cgw  Crdii  Kdecay
TSS     MG/L   0      0    0      0

[LANDUSES]
;;Name
LU1
LU2
LU3

[COVERAGES]
;;Subcat  LandUse  Percent  LandUse  Percent  LandUse  Percent
S1        LU1      100      LU2      100
S2        LU1      33.33    LU2      33.33    LU3      33.34
S3        LU1      60
S3        LU2      50

[TIMESERIES]
;;Name  Time  Value
R1      0:00  1.0
R1      0:30  0.0

[COORDINATES]
J1  0    0
O1  100  0
